Well, you thought wrong.

00:40:32.670 --> 00:40:34.869
Leave the stuff. I'll do it myself.

00:40:34.909 --> 00:40:36.710
I told you, i'm not gonna let you kill anyone.

00:40:36.740 --> 00:40:39.070
It's none of your damn business what i do!

00:40:43.340 --> 00:40:46.710
You want your brother back so bad...

00:40:55.769 --> 00:40:57.710
...fine.

00:40:57.740 --> 00:41:00.210
What are you talking about?

00:41:00.240 --> 00:41:02.369
Better me than a civilian.

00:41:05.740 --> 00:41:08.769
You're crazy, bobby. I'm not killing you.

00:41:08.809 --> 00:41:11.539
Oh. Now i'm the crazy one.

00:41:14.170 --> 00:41:16.970
Look, sam.

00:41:17.010 --> 00:41:18.539
I'm old.

00:41:18.570 --> 00:41:20.670
I'm coming near the end of my trail.

00:41:20.710 --> 00:41:25.409
But you can keep fighting, saving folk.

00:41:25.440 --> 00:41:28.970
But you need your brother.

00:41:29.010 --> 00:41:31.010
So let me give him back to you.

00:41:31.039 --> 00:41:33.769
Bobby...

00:41:33.809 --> 00:41:35.539
You and dean, you...

00:41:35.570 --> 00:41:39.610
You boys are the closest thing i have to family.

00:41:42.170 --> 00:41:44.809
I want to do this.

00:41:47.510 --> 00:41:49.210
Okay.

00:41:49.240 --> 00:41:51.769
Good.

00:42:02.440 --> 00:42:04.010
Just make it quick.

00:42:06.740 --> 00:42:10.039
Do it, son.

00:42:10.070 --> 00:42:12.269
Yeah, okay, bobby.

00:42:14.639 --> 00:42:16.940
But you want to know why?

00:42:21.710 --> 00:42:24.510
Because you're not bobby.

00:42:36.070 --> 00:42:37.139
Bobby.

00:42:39.769 --> 00:42:41.139
Bobby.

00:42:43.940 --> 00:42:45.539
Bobby!

00:42:54.940 --> 00:42:57.909
You're right. I was just screwing with you.

00:42:57.940 --> 00:43:01.070
Pretty good, though, sam. Smart.

00:43:01.110 --> 00:43:03.840
Let me tell ya.

00:43:03.869 --> 00:43:06.139
Whoever said dean was the dysfunctional one

00:43:06.170 --> 00:43:08.869
Has never seen you with a sharp 
object in your hands.

00:43:08.909 --> 00:43:12.039
Holy "full metal jacket."

00:43:12.070 --> 00:43:14.039
Bring him back.

00:43:14.070 --> 00:43:16.840
Who? Dean?

00:43:18.440 --> 00:43:21.409
Didn't my girl send you the flowers?

00:43:21.440 --> 00:43:24.469
Dean's dead. He ain't coming back.

00:43:24.509 --> 00:43:28.440
His soul's downstairs doing 
the hellfire rumba as we speak.

00:43:28.469 --> 00:43:31.539
Just take us back to that tuesday 
-- Or wednesday

00:43:31.570 --> 00:43:34.139
When it all started, please.

00:43:34.170 --> 00:43:35.969
We won't come after you. I swear.

00:43:36.009 --> 00:43:37.869
You swear?

00:43:37.909 --> 00:43:39.210
Yes.

00:43:39.239 --> 00:43:41.509
I don't know.

00:43:41.539 --> 00:43:43.110
Even if i could...

00:43:43.139 --> 00:43:45.170
- You can.
- True.

00:43:45.210 --> 00:43:47.070
But that don't mean i should.

00:43:47.110 --> 00:43:51.239
Sam, there's a lesson here

00:43:51.269 --> 00:43:52.769
That i've been trying to drill

00:43:52.809 --> 00:43:56.409
Into that freakish, cro-Magnon skull of yours.

00:43:56.440 --> 00:44:00.039
Lesson? What lesson?

00:44:00.070 --> 00:44:03.139
This obsession to save dean.

00:44:03.170 --> 00:44:07.340
The way you two keep sacrificing
yourselves for each other.

00:44:07.369 --> 00:44:10.610
Nothing good comes out of it.

00:44:10.639 --> 00:44:12.539
Just blood and pain.

00:44:15.840 --> 00:44:18.909
Dean's your weakness.

00:44:18.940 --> 00:44:22.869
The bad guys know it, too.

00:44:22.909 --> 00:44:25.110
He's gonna be the death of you, sam.

00:44:28.809 --> 00:44:32.809
Sometimes you just got to let people go.

00:44:32.840 --> 00:44:35.139
He's my brother.

00:44:35.170 --> 00:44:37.509
Yep.

00:44:37.539 --> 00:44:40.670
And like it or not, 

00:44:40.710 --> 00:44:43.269
This is what life's gonna be like without him.

00:44:43.309 --> 00:44:46.539
Please. Just...

00:44:49.170 --> 00:44:51.670
Please.

00:44:54.239 --> 00:44:57.840
I swear, it's like talking to a brick wall.

00:45:00.509 --> 00:45:02.570
Okay, look.

00:45:02.610 --> 00:45:05.539
This all stopped being fun months ago.

00:45:05.570 --> 00:45:07.769
You're travis bickel in a skirt, pal.

00:45:07.809 --> 00:45:08.940
I'm over it.

00:45:08.969 --> 00:45:10.369
Meaning what?

00:45:10.409 --> 00:45:13.369
Meaning that's for me to know and you to find out.

00:45:24.340 --> 00:45:26.539
What, are you gonna sleep all day?

00:45:26.570 --> 00:45:29.840
I know. No asia. This station sucks.

00:45:35.009 --> 00:45:37.110
It's wednesday.

00:45:37.139 --> 00:45:39.610
Yeah. Which usually follows tuesday.

00:45:39.639 --> 00:45:41.039
Turn that thing off.

00:45:50.940 --> 00:45:52.940
Dude, how many tuesdays did you have?

00:45:52.969 --> 00:45:55.309
Enough.

00:45:55.340 --> 00:45:56.469
Wait.

00:45:58.610 --> 00:46:00.440
What do you remember?

00:46:00.469 --> 00:46:03.469
I remember you were pretty whacked out yesterday.

00:46:03.509 --> 00:46:06.369
I remember catching up with the trickster.

00:46:06.409 --> 00:46:08.170
That's about it.

00:46:11.440 --> 00:46:12.739
Let's go.

00:46:12.769 --> 00:46:13.840
No breakfast?

00:46:13.869 --> 00:46:16.369
No breakfast.

00:46:16.409 --> 00:46:18.639
All right. I'll pack the car.

00:46:18.670 --> 00:46:20.340
Wait. You're not going anywhere alone.

00:46:20.369 --> 00:46:22.009
It's the parking lot, sam.

00:46:22.039 --> 00:46:23.039
Just...

00:46:23.070 --> 00:46:26.039
Just trust me.

00:46:32.269 --> 00:46:35.009
Hey, you don't look so good. Something else happen?

00:46:38.309 --> 00:46:41.539
I just had a really weird dream.

00:46:41.570 --> 00:46:44.269
Clowns or midgets?



00:00:0.500 --> 00:00:2.00
